      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i need some help with something weird. i've been noticing this intense feeling in my bones, like a heavy pressure shifting inside them, and it always happens right before a storm hits. it's getting so precise that i'm convinced my body is acting like a biological barometer. can you help me find some current barometric pressure readings for my area? i want to see if my bone sensations actually line up with the numbers so i can calibrate what i'm feeling.",
